{{For|normal achievements|Achievements}}
'''{{Keyword|secret|Secret Achievements}}''' are a special set of achievements located in the '''Secrets''' tab inside {{Keyword|ach| Achievements}} menu. Their unlock conditions are hidden from players and only become visible if the specified requirements are met. These achievements are usually obtained through unusual but specific actions. There are currently {{Keyword|secret|55 Secret Achievements}} in the game (version #1.046).

Each '''Secret''' comes with a hint of how to obtain it. Some Secrets will also provide a '''Secret Bonus''' when unlocked that acts as a hint to obtain a different '''Secret'''.

You will earn a bonus of {{Keyword|tf|+0.1% [[Time Flux|{{Keyword|tf|Time Flux}}]] gain}} for every {{Keyword|secret|Secret Achievement}} obtained.

'''<big>Important note: In this page's Obtaining method part is a quick summary for each Secret Achievement. For a detailed guide see [[Guide:Secret Achievements]]</big>'''
